      </div>

      <h1>
        Your smile.
        <span>Our passion.</span>
      </h1>

      <p>
        Modern dental care designed around your comfort,
        confidence and long-term oral health.
      </p>

      <div class="buttons">
        <a href="booking.html" class="btn btn-primary">
          Book an Appointment
        </a>

        <a href="#services" class="btn btn-secondary">
          Explore Our Services
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="intro">
  <div class="intro-grid">

    <div class="intro-card">
      <div class="intro-icon">✓</div>
      <div>
        <strong>Professional Care</strong>
        <span>Experienced dental professionals</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-card">
      <div class="intro-icon">✦</div>
      <div>
        <strong>Modern Dentistry</strong>
        <span>Comfortable modern treatment</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-card">
      <div class="intro-icon">♡</div>
      <div>
        <strong>Patient First</strong>
        <span>Care designed around you</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="section-inner">

    <div class="about-grid">

      <div class="about-photo"></div>

      <div class="about-content">

        <div class="kicker">
          WHY BRIGHTSMILE
        </div>

        <h2>
          Professional care
          <span>with a human touch.</span>
        </h2>

        <p>
          We combine modern dental technology,
          experienced professionals and personalized
          treatment plans to make every visit
          comfortable, effective and stress-free.
        </p>

        <div class="check-list">

          <div class="check">
            <div class="check-icon">✓</div>
            Comfortable patient experience
          </div>

          <div class="check">
            <div class="check-icon">✓</div>
            Modern dental technology
          </div>

          <div class="check">
            <div class="check-icon">✓</div>
            Personalized treatment plans
          </div>

          <div class="check">
            <div class="check-icon">✓</div>
            Professional dental team
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="services" id="services">
  <div class="section-inner">

    <div class="center-head">

      <div class="kicker">
        OUR SERVICES
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">
        Complete dental care.
      </h2>

      <p class="section-text">
        From everyday preventive care to advanced
        cosmetic and restorative treatments,
        we help you protect and improve your smile.
